    [Bugfix] Validate DeepSeek V4 tensor parallel limits (#18418)
    
    ## Summary
    
    - validate tensor-parallel limits for DeepSeek V4.1, V4 Flash, and V4
    Pro models
    - enforce A2/A3 limits of TP <= 8 for V4.1/Flash and TP <= 16 for V4 Pro
    - disallow TP > 1 on A5
    - apply validation to Model Runner V2 and to Model Runner V1 when DSA-CP
    is disabled
    - add unit coverage for device, runner, DSA-CP, boundary, and
    unrelated-model cases
    
    ## Tests
    
    - `py -3 -m py_compile vllm_ascend/platform.py
    tests/ut/test_platform.py`
    - `git diff --check`
    - targeted NPU unit tests were not run locally because this workspace
    requires a remote torch_npu environment
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8cc9aa5ad350f6f80cf3bebb298d410803ff75a9
    
    Signed-off-by: chenmenglong <chenmenglong1@huawei.com>

